---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="Zhejiang Guangjin Intelligent Technology Co., Ltd. (Brand: GRANGIN) — 20+ years focus on transmission industry. National High-Tech Enterprise, ISO 9001/45001/14001 certified. Located in Shengzhou, Zhejiang, China.">
  
  <section class="bg-dark-900 text-white py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="container-page">
      <p class="text-brand-400 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">About GRANGIN</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black">20+ Years Focus on Transmission Industry</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-py bg-white">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-steel-900 mb-4">Zhejiang Guangjin Intelligent Technology Co., Ltd.</h2>
          <p class="text-steel-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Brand <strong class="text-brand-600">GRANGIN</strong>, headquartered at No. 862, Sanjie High-tech Park, Shengzhou City, Zhejiang Province, China. We specialize in transmission components — gears, sprockets, belt pulleys, gear motors, and CNC machined parts.
          </p>
          <p class="text-steel-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            With over 20 years dedicated to the transmission industry, GRANGIN has grown into a recognized leader. We are a <strong>National High-Tech Enterprise</strong> (2022) and a <strong>"Science and Technology Little Giant"</strong> (2023). We have repeatedly earned "Integrity Enterprise" and "Grade-A Taxpayer" designations.
          </p>
          <p class="text-steel-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Certified to ISO 9001, ISO 45001, and ISO 14001 quality standards, we integrate trading with in-house manufacturing supported by advanced CNC machinery and a 2,000 m² material preparation warehouse.
          </p>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-brand-50 rounded-lg">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600">10K+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">Factory Area m²</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-brand-50 rounded-lg">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600">25K+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">Monthly Output</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-brand-50 rounded-lg">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600">25+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">QC Professionals</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-steel-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center p-8">
            <div class="text-7xl mb-3">🏭</div>
            <p class="text-steel-400 text-sm">No. 862, Sanjie High-tech Park, Shengzhou, Zhejiang</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Journey -->
  <section class="section-py bg-steel-50">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-steel-900 mb-3">
          Our <span class="text-brand-600">Journey</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-steel-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Manufacturing experience since 2005. Global service through Ceten.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Intro paragraphs -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <p class="text-steel-600 leading-relaxed text-base mb-4">
          Ceten was created with one clear purpose: to make it easier for global customers to source reliable power transmission products from China.
        </p>
        <p class="text-steel-600 leading-relaxed text-base">
          Behind Ceten is Zhejiang Guangjin Intelligent Technology Co., Ltd., a manufacturing company with experience dating back to 2005. From gearboxes and gear motors to gears, sprockets, shafts, and precision machined parts, Guangjin provides the production foundation and quality control support for Ceten.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Subsection: From Manufacturing to Global Service -->
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-steel-900 text-center mb-8">
        From Manufacturing to <span class="text-brand-600">Global Service</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <!-- Card 1: 2005 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-steel-100 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-brand-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">2005</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-3">Manufacturing Foundation</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500 leading-relaxed">Guangjin's manufacturing experience began with transmission components and precision machined parts, building the technical base for today's product range.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Production Capability -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-steel-100 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.066 2.573c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573 1.066c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066-2.573c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-3">Production Capability</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500 leading-relaxed">With CNC machining, testing equipment, and production management experience, Guangjin supports Ceten with stable quality and flexible manufacturing capacity.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Ceten -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-brand-50/50">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-3">Ceten — Built for Overseas Customers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500 leading-relaxed">Ceten focuses on international communication, export service, technical support, and OEM/customized solutions for global industrial customers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Subsection: What This Means for You -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-steel-900 text-center mb-8">
          What This Means for <span class="text-brand-600">You</span>
        </h3>

        <div class="bg-white border border-steel-100 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Easier communication for technical requirements</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reliable manufacturing support from Guangjin</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Flexible OEM and customized transmission parts</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Stable quality control from production to shipment</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Long-term support for global B2B cooperation</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Closing -->
        <p class="text-steel-600 leading-relaxed text-base text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Ceten is not only a trading name. It is the overseas service platform built on Guangjin's manufacturing experience, helping customers find efficient, reliable, and customized power transmission solutions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose -->
  <section class="section-py bg-steel-50">
    <div class="container-page">
      <h2 class="section-title">Why Choose <span class="text-brand-600">GRANGIN</span></h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mt-10">
        <div class="card-base p-6">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-2">Expert Customization</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500">Chief Engineer with 30+ years in automation. Average engineering tenure 15+ years. 3D custom design blueprints.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-base p-6">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">⏱️</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-2">Reliable Service</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500">12-hour response guarantee. Prompt quotation and customized solution feedback.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-base p-6">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🚀</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-2">Rapid Delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500">Priority fast-track for urgent orders. Optimized production scheduling coordination.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-base p-6">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">💎</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-steel-900 mb-2">High-Value Solutions</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-steel-500">25+ QC professionals. Three manual inspections per product. Export-grade packaging.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Certifications -->
  <section class="section-py bg-white">
    <div class="container-page text-center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Quality <span class="text-brand-600">Certifications</span></h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 mt-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-steel-200 px-8 py-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-600">ISO 9001</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">Quality Management</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-steel-200 px-8 py-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-600">ISO 45001</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">Occupational Health & Safety</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-steel-200 px-8 py-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-600">ISO 14001</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">Environmental Management</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-brand-200 px-8 py-6 shadow-sm bg-brand-50">
          <div class="text-xl font-black text-brand-600">🏆 National</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">High-Tech Enterprise 2022</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-brand-200 px-8 py-6 shadow-sm bg-brand-50">
          <div class="text-xl font-black text-brand-600">🏅 Little</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-500 mt-1">Science & Tech Giant 2023</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-brand-600 text-white text-center">
    <div class="container-page">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Work with GRANGIN</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-100 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">Fully supports customized drawings and 35+ materials. Contact us today.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-white text-base px-8 py-3.5 font-bold">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
